### Registrar usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre_completo": "Juan Pérez",
  "usuario": "admin",
  "password": "1234",
  "rol": "admin"
}



### Login (obtener JWT)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "admin",
  "password": "1234"
}

### Ejemplo: usar el token en rutas protegidas
# Copia el token obtenido en el login y reemplázalo en {{token}}


### Obtener restaurante del usuario
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Obtener restaurante del usuario
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear restaurante
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mi Restaurante",
  "address": "Calle 123"
}

### Actualizar restaurante
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Restaurante Actualizado",
  "address": "Calle 456"
}

### Eliminar restaurante
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar categorías
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Entradas"
}

### Actualizar categoría
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Platos principales"
}

### Eliminar categoría
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reordenar categorías
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/categories/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order": [2, 1, 3]
}

### Listar platos
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/admin/dishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}